From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:19:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,macaudio: Add the J604 jack

The MacBook Pro 14" M4 (J604) headphone jack is a card of its own on
the AOP, like the J614s, J616s and J713 ones.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index e0b330720f..2f83d4c126 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
           - apple,j274-macaudio
           - apple,j293-macaudio
           - apple,j314-macaudio
+          - apple,j604-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j614-macaudio
           - apple,j614-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j616-macaudio
